# camp-cast: load saved game A, make camp, Magic (M), pick Bakshi (End) and cast: Cure Light Wounds twice (Home to the spell, Enter, then Enter on
# the one to heal), Detect Magic; then Brother Sean's turn at the list. Covers the camp casting path: ovl15 (CampMagicMenu, the party pick),
# ovl19 (ChooseSpellFromList), ovl22 (PickSpellFromMenu, CastCureLightWounds, CastDetectionSpell, ApplySpellToTargets), ovl24
# (HealCharacter), ovl12 affects. Found by trying the camp menus on the explorer (tools/c/explore_run.sh). The camp screen is animated, so its keys
# are `press` with waits of 30 ticks (a longer wait stalls the oracle at a blocking prompt).
clock 12:00:16.58
wheel
wait 20
key L
wait 20
key A
wait 300
press E
wait 100
press M
wait 30
press END
wait 30
press C
wait 30
press HOME
wait 30
press HOME
wait 30
press ENTER
wait 30
press ENTER
wait 60
shot cure-one
press HOME
wait 30
press HOME
wait 30
press ENTER
wait 30
press ENTER
wait 60
press HOME
wait 30
press ENTER
wait 60
press ESC
wait 30
press END
wait 30
press END
wait 30
press C
wait 30
press ENTER
wait 30
press ENTER
wait 60
shot cast-end
wait 30
quit
